# Brainstorm docs site consistently times out from GitHub Actions runners but loads
# normally in browsers (verified 2026-10-03). The Brainstorm GitHub repo link is still checked.
^https://neuroimage\.usc\.edu/

# Figshare DOIs return HTTP 202 (bot challenge) to automated clients. Records are verified
# via the Figshare API instead (HEFMI-ICH, 10.6084/m9.figshare.28955456, checked 2026-10-03).
^https://doi\.org/10\.6084/m9\.figshare\.

# sleepdata.org (NSRR) serves an incomplete TLS chain (leaf only, missing the Sectigo DV R36
# intermediate), so OpenSSL-based checkers reject it; browsers fetch the intermediate. Verified 2026-10-03.
^https://sleepdata\.org/
